Error [E0112]: `widen` wants `MAX` for argument 1, but this is Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/type_alias_bare_path_to_a_value_is_a_constant.jet:10:17
    |
 10 |     print(widen(1))
    |                 ^
 Why: Every argument must match its parameter's type
 Fix: Use `MAX` here
